                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0df58be1-3bd3-3b3c-86b6-75b1a4794f74",
                        "entry_id": "62002ae6-1c24-3195-ac7e-7deb73c051b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who dislikes and distrusts all government."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77082f88-4fa3-4651-9482-4101836dfe6a",
                                "sense_id": "0df58be1-3bd3-3b3c-86b6-75b1a4794f74",
                                "text": "It is supposed to do this now, and only misarchists will deny that it generally does so, albeit an intelligence of a rather low order, as ought to be expected from a body that does not pretend to do more than represent the intelligence of its constituents, including the lowest as well as the highest, i.e., a body representing approximately the average social intelligence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4536f3e3-93de-4684-8c74-c33932805ebb",
                                "sense_id": "0df58be1-3bd3-3b3c-86b6-75b1a4794f74",
                                "text": "Such is the position taken by the school of misarchist who are habitually denouncing government as a mere band of politicians who at any time happen to hold office."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a46f8148-590e-4c9e-a73e-164b2a5164cf",
                                "sense_id": "0df58be1-3bd3-3b3c-86b6-75b1a4794f74",
                                "text": "Nietzsche was no friend, it seems, of the \"misarchists\" who hated strong rulers, for such misarchists might interfere with Nietzsche's first and foremost concern: the production of spiritually strong beings known as Ubermenschen (Overmen)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
